# Explicit fallback for Debian 13 (trixie), GCC/GFortran 14, OpenMPI 5,
# FFTW 3, LP64 OpenBLAS and ScaLAPACK. Not a cross-distribution ABI guarantee.
# Use with --shlibs-local only when these match the build/installation stack.
# Normal installed symbols/shlibs metadata is preferable. Unknown libraries
# still cause an error; the scanner is never told to ignore missing metadata.
# Floors below target the Debian 13 baseline, not per-binary symbol minima.
# Package identities: https://packages.debian.org/trixie/
